title: District Development Council elections announced
view-if: year = 1981 and month = 6 and week = 1
max-visits: 1
tags: event
new-page: true

= District Development Council election results

The ballots have been counted and the results are now in for the District Development Council's 156 elected seats for every district. [? if ddc_elections_boycott = 0 : Lets hope our campaining has paid off ?] [? if ddc_elections_boycott = 1 : Without our participation, the UNP is likely to sweep the Sinhalese south west  ?]

Voter turnout was very low, with only 20-30% of voters showing up to vote.

- @results: Lets see the results

@results
on-arrival: in_election = 0
go-to: slfp_results if ddc_elections_boycott == 0; cannon_results if ddc_elections_boycott == 1; cannon_results

Island Wide Results are as follows

